WEBVTT

00:10:29.311 --> 00:10:31.119
maaumivu ya mwingine.

00:10:32.258 --> 00:10:37.152
Madhara ya ukatili wa kijinsia
yalisemwa kwa sauti na hisia,

00:10:37.176 --> 00:10:38.506
uso kwa uso.

00:10:39.979 --> 00:10:41.482
Wakati mwingine,

00:10:41.506 --> 00:10:44.140
tuligundua ubayana uliyongezeka,

00:10:45.164 --> 00:10:49.564
na hata vicheko visivyotarajiwa
lakini vilitukomboa .

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.780
Ki ukweli,

00:10:52.804 --> 00:10:56.432
tulijitahidi kusikilizana kwa makini.

00:10:57.404 --> 00:11:03.245
Na hali halisi yetu binafsi ziliwasilihwa kwa uhalisia wake
